  "source_code": "t = int(input())\r\nfor _ in range(t):\r\n    n = int(input())\r\n    r = sorted(map(int, input().split()),reverse = True)\r\n    P = [0]\r\n    for v in r:\r\n        P.append(P[-1] + v)\r\n        \r\n    f = lambda a, b: 2*P[a]+P[a+2*b]+3*P[3*n-2*a-b]\r\n    \r\n    ans = 0\r\n    b = n\r\n    for a in range(n+1):\r\n        b = min(b,n-a)\r\n        while b>0 and f(a ,b-1) > f(a,b): \r\n            b-=1\r\n        ans = max(ans, f(a,b))\r\n    print(ans)",
